      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.historicalsocietyofwindhamcounty.org/"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "By 1859, Newfane industries included a large carriage factory, flour mills, lumber mills, and manufacturers of leather and linseed oil.",
